  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#concept-get-xml-encoding-when-sniffing\r\n\r\n> 7. If the byte at encodingPosition is not 0x3D (=), then return failure.\r\n> \r\n> 8. While the byte at encodingPosition is less than or equal to 0x20 (i.e., it is either an ASCII space or control character), advance encodingPosition to the next byte.\r\n> \r\n> 9. Let quoteMark be the byte at encodingPosition.\r\n\r\nThis never advances _encodingPosition_ past the `=` byte, meaning that _quoteMark_ can never be a quotation mark. Step 7 should probably read something like:\r\n\r\n> 7. If the byte at encodingPosition is 0x3D (=), then advance encodingPosition to the next byte. Otherwise, return failure.",
